0 -14 Td
(## Functional Specification Document) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(### Revision Note) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- This revision reflects the implemented study behavior as of 2026-04-04.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- The study is now PV-first and banner-driven. Analytical subgraph plotting is no longer part of the operational design.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(## 1. Purpose) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Track interaction of lower timeframe bars \(for example, 1-minute bars\) relative to prior higher timeframe Period OHLC values provided by a Sierra Chart Period OHLC study.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Expose the resulting state through persistent variables for use by other studies.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Display a compact status banner that updates only when its displayed values change.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(## 2. Core Logic) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Evaluate only on closed bars.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Use manual looping only: `sc.AutoLoop = 0`.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Do not simulate Period OHLC behavior internally.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Treat a change in referenced HTF OHLC values as a new higher timeframe period and reset per-period breach state.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Study graph region is `0`.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(## 3. Reference Values) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `PO = Period Open`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `PH = Period High`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `PL = Period Low`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `PC = Period Close`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `UpperInner = max\(PO, PC\)`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `LowerInner = min\(PO, PC\)`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `Mid50 = PL + 0.5 * \(PH - PL\)`) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(## 4. Zone Classification) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Zone is determined from the lower timeframe close relative to `PH`, `UpperInner`, `LowerInner`, and `PL`.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Encoded values are:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `10 = ABOVE_HIGH`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `1 = L1`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `2 = L2`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `3 = L3`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `-10 = BELOW_LOW`) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(### Zone Layout) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `L1 = High-side outer band = PH -> UpperInner`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `L2 = Inner body band = UpperInner -> LowerInner`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `L3 = Low-side outer band = LowerInner -> PL`) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(## 5. Midpoint State) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `-1 = BELOW_50`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `0 = AT_50`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `1 = ABOVE_50`) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
ET
