(## 6. Width Calculations) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `L1 = PH - UpperInner`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `L2 = UpperInner - LowerInner`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `L3 = LowerInner - PL`) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(### Percent Width Display) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- The banner shows the relative split of the HTF range as `L1:L2:L3`.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- This corresponds to `top:middle:bottom`.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(## 7. Breach Logic) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- High breach per bar: `BarHigh > PH`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Low breach per bar: `BarLow < PL`) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(## 8. Per-Period Breach State) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `1 = INSIDE_ONLY`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `2 = HIGH_BREACHED_ONLY`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `3 = LOW_BREACHED_ONLY`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `4 = BOTH_SIDES_BREACHED`) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(## 9. Engulfing Logic) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `1 = Bullish` if `close > PH`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `-1 = Bearish` if `close < PL`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `0 = Non-directional` otherwise) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(## 10. Reset Conditions) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Reset all per-period breach tracking state when referenced Period OHLC values change.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
